@startuml
|User|
:Request password reset;
:Enter email address;

|ForgotPasswordPage|
:Receive password reset request;
:Send reset link to AuthService;

|AuthService|
:Generate reset token;
:Store token and expiration in Database;
:Send reset email with token to User;

|User|
:Receive password reset email;
:Click on reset link in email;
:Enter new password and confirm;

|ResetPasswordPage|
:Receive new password submission;
:Verify reset token validity;
if (Token valid?) then (yes)
    :Update password in Database;
    |EmailService|
    :Send password reset confirmation;
    :Notify ForgotPasswordPage of success;
else (no)
    :Notify ForgotPasswordPage of failure;
endif

|ForgotPasswordPage|
if (Password reset successful?) then (yes)
    :Show success message;
else (no)
    :Show error message;
endif

|User|
if (Password reset successful?) then (yes)
    :Login with new password;
else (no)
    :Retry or contact support;
endif

@enduml
